Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Mauro Icardi represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**BREAKING NEWS**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 19, "end": 77, "text": "Mauro Icardi's Shocking Move: Argentine Striker Joins U.C."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 78, "end": 87, "text": "Sampdoria"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 89, "end": 189, "text": "In a stunning transfer move, Argentine association football player Mauro Icardi has signed with U.C."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 190, "end": 242, "text": "Sampdoria, the Italian football club based in Genoa."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 243, "end": 406, "text": "This news has sent shockwaves throughout the football community, with fans and pundits alike scrambling to understand the implications of this unexpected transfer."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 407, "end": 583, "text": "According to sources close to the deal, Icardi, who has previously played for Paris Saint-Germain and Inter Milan, has put pen to paper on a multi-year contract with Sampdoria."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 584, "end": 709, "text": "The 29-year-old striker is expected to bring his goal-scoring prowess to the Stadio Luigi Ferraris, Sampdoria's home stadium."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 710, "end": 876, "text": "\"Icardi is a world-class player who will undoubtedly bring a new level of excitement to our team,\" said Sampdoria's President, Marco Lanna, in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 877, "end": 997, "text": "\"We are thrilled to have him on board and are confident that he will help us achieve our goals for the upcoming season.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 998, "end": 1156, "text": "Data from Transfermarkt, a reputable football transfer database, confirms that Icardi has indeed joined Sampdoria, with the deal reportedly worth €15 million."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1157, "end": 1269, "text": "This move marks a significant coup for the Italian club, which has been seeking to bolster its attacking lineup."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1270, "end": 1391, "text": "\"Icardi's signing is a massive statement of intent from Sampdoria,\" said Italian football journalist, Gianluca Di Marzio."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1392, "end": 1474, "text": "\"He is a proven goal-scorer with a wealth of experience in top-level competitions."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1475, "end": 1554, "text": "This move will undoubtedly raise the profile of the club and attract new fans.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1555, "end": 1682, "text": "Icardi's impressive career statistics, which include 162 goals in 274 appearances, make him an attractive addition to any team."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1683, "end": 1790, "text": "His ability to find the back of the net has earned him recognition as one of the top strikers in the world."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1791, "end": 1904, "text": "As the football world continues to digest this surprise transfer, one thing is clear: Mauro Icardi's move to U.C."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1905, "end": 1954, "text": "Sampdoria is a game-changer for the Italian club."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1955, "end": 2036, "text": "With Icardi leading the line, Sampdoria fans can expect an exciting season ahead."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2037, "end": 2051, "text": "**FACT CHECK**"}, "D1S22": {"document_