Capocannoniere award in the 2017-2018 season."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 783, "end": 786, "text": "[3]"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 788, "end": 820, "text": "Transfer to FC Anzhi Makhachkala"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 822, "end": 946, "text": "On August 10, 2022, Icardi made a surprise move to FC Anzhi Makhachkala, signing a four-year contract with the Russian club."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 947, "end": 1065, "text": "[4] The transfer was reportedly worth €25 million, making it one of the largest transfers in Russian football history."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1066, "end": 1069, "text": "[5]"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1071, "end": 1093, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1095, "end": 1348, "text": "A study published in the Journal of Sports Science and Medicine found that Icardi's move to FC Anzhi Makhachkala was a strategic decision, citing the club's investment in youth development and its ambition to become a top-tier team in European football."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1349, "end": 1352, "text": "[6]"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1354, "end": 1555, "text": "In an interview with Russian sports magazine, Sport-Express, Icardi stated that he was attracted to FC Anzhi Makhachkala's \"ambitious project\" and the opportunity to play in the Russian Premier League."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1556, "end": 1559, "text": "[7]"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1561, "end": 1572, "text": "References:"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1574, "end": 1693, "text": "[1] \"Newell's Old Boys youth academy: A breeding ground for talent\" by Juan Pablo Sorín, published in El Gráfico, 2012."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1694, "end": 1804, "text": "[2] \"Icardi: The rise of a goal-scoring machine\" by Luca Bianchin, published in La Gazzetta dello Sport, 2013."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1805, "end": 1882, "text": "[3] \"Icardi wins Capocannoniere award\" by Inter Milan official website, 2018."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "Mauro Icardi", "scope": "sports teams previously represented", "claim": "Mauro Icardi previously played for Paris Saint-Germain and Inter Milan.", "answer": "Paris Saint-Germain and Inter Milan", "quote": "According to sources close to the deal, Icardi, who has previously played for Paris Saint-Germain and Inter Milan, has put pen to paper on a multi-year contract with Sampdoria.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["U.C. Sampdoria", "FC Anzhi Makhachkala", "Paris Saint-Germain and Inter Milan"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "U.C. Sampdoria", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "FC Anzhi Makhachkala", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Paris Saint-Germain and Inter Milan", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}
